	<key>readme</key>
	<string>A powerful Alfred workflow for complete tmux session management with multi-terminal support (iTerm2, Ghostty, Terminal.app).&#32;

List, create, attach, detach, and delete sessions with rich status info. Shows attached/detached status, window count, and activity times. Smart sorting puts active sessions first. Create linked sessions for independent window navigation across multiple terminal windows. Auto-detects your preferred terminal or manually configure in workflow settings.

Perfect for developers juggling multiple tmux sessions.

Use Enter to attach, ⇧+Enter for linked sessions, ⌘+Enter to delete, ⌃+Enter to detach.</string>
